    overview: "It answers the question every organiser asks first — what will my event cost? — before a single vendor is called. Enter your event type, your guest count and your city tier, and you get a total budget range, a per-guest range, and a category-by-category split of where the money goes. A 300-guest wedding in a Tier 1 city runs ₹15,00,000–₹33,00,000 — ₹5,000–₹11,000 a guest — with venue and catering taking half the budget between them.",
