    exampleConclusion: "Raising the step-up from 0% to 10% turns ₹11,61,695 into ₹16,87,163 — ₹5,25,468 more — on ₹3,56,245 more invested. Going to 15% turns it into ₹20,59,364. In a step-up SIP, the rise you can sustain matters as much as the amount you start with.",
