    returnsConclusion: "Four percentage points of assumed return — 8% against 12% — move the estimated value from ₹13,78,959 to ₹16,87,163. That is why the return you type in matters more than any other input, and why it should be a planning assumption, never a promise.",
    goalTargets: [1000000, 2500000, 5000000, 10000000, 20000000],
