      ["Read the price, the loan and which limit binds", "Your maximum home price, the loan and EMI behind it, the loan-to-value ratio, whether your income or the property value is the limit, a comfortable price at 40% FOIR, a stretch price at 55%, and what closing your other EMIs or a rate 1 point lower would add."]
