    "modelNote": "Percentage off: discount = original price × discount % ÷ 100, and the sale price = original price − discount. Flat off: sale price = original price − flat amount, and the effective discount = flat amount ÷ original price × 100. Successive discounts: apply the first percentage, then apply the second percentage to the reduced price — the two percentages multiply, they never add. GST, when switched on, is charged on the discounted price: GST = sale price × GST rate ÷ 100, and the total payable = sale price + GST. Every step is rounded to the nearest paise.",
