    "modelNote": "Gain = sale value − buy value, for the units sold. A sale below the buy price is a loss — no tax — and this tool does not work out loss set-off. Listed equity and equity-oriented funds (STT paid) split at 12 months: 12 months or less is STCG at 20% on the full gain; more than 12 months is LTCG at 12.5% on the gain above the ₹1.25 lakh annual exemption, which is shared across all your equity LTCG in the year and used up in the order the sales are entered. Other assets — property, gold, unlisted shares — split at 24 months: 24 months or less is STCG at your slab rate, which this tool does not calculate; more than 24 months is LTCG at 12.5% flat, with no exemption and no indexation. Debt funds bought on or after 1 April 2023 are always taxed at the slab rate. Tax with cess = tax × 1.04. Surcharge is not included. Money is rounded to paise.",
