        "THE CESS",
        "Entering the tax before surcharge and cess",
        "The 4% health and education cess and any surcharge are part of the liability. Leave them out and every instalment falls short, and the interest is charged on the shortfall — 1234tools' first mistake to avoid. Work out the full year's tax first; the Income Tax calculator includes both."
