        "What is the GST on gold jewellery?",
        "GST is 3% on gold jewellery, coins and bars — 1.5% CGST plus 1.5% SGST — on the whole bill including making charges. The 5% rate applies only to job work, when you give your own gold to a goldsmith to make or remake a piece. The rates did not change in the September 2025 GST reform."
