        "detail": "A single salaried person in a secure job may manage with 3 months; a private-sector employee with dependants or a single-income family should aim for 6 to 9; freelancers and business owners need 9 to 12. moneymindtool.com's profile table prices it at Rs.50,000 a month: 3 months is Rs.1.5 lakh, 6 months is Rs.3 lakh, 9 months is Rs.4.5 lakh and 12 months is Rs.6 lakh. The preset buttons set the months; the guide table shows the reasoning.",
        "rule": "Your household decides the months, not the calculator"
