    "checklist": [
      "Are the length and width measured wall to wall \u2014 and in the right unit, feet or metres?",
      "Is the ceiling height the real one \u2014 10 ft is standard, but a 12 ft ceiling needs 20% more cooling?",
      "Is the sun exposure honest \u2014 is the room really shaded, or does it face west or sit under the roof?",
      "Are the people counted \u2014 the first two are already in the baseline, each extra person adds 0.1 ton?",
      "Is cooking heat ticked if the room is a kitchen or a kitchen-diner \u2014 it adds 0.5 ton?",
      "Is the recommendation rounded UP \u2014 a 1.2-ton load means a 1.5-ton AC, never a 1-ton AC?",
      "Is the room above 360 sq ft \u2014 and if so, have you planned for two ACs or a larger system instead of one oversized split?",
      "Is the star rating checked on the ISEER table, not on a 'saves 20\u201325%' slogan?",
      "Is this a planning estimate \u2014 and will you get a dealer or installer assessment before buying for a large or unusual room?"
    ],
