      "Is the cover at least 10× income — and does the needs-based figure (loans in, existing cover out) say you need more?",
      "Does the term run to the last year your dependants need the income — usually 60 or 65?",
      "Are the riders chosen deliberately — CI and ADB priced, ROP understood at 2.3×, waiver at 5%?",
      "Have you compared annual and monthly — monthly costs 5% more over the year?",
      "Is the tax regime right — 80C saving only under the old regime, and the death benefit tax-free either way?",
      "Do you remember this is an estimate, not a quote — and that the 30-day free-look period is for checking the documents?"
