      "Is the own-damage rate your insurer's rate — or the 2.5% default, which is a representative figure, not your insurer's price?",
      "Is the no-claim bonus right — 20% after one claim-free year, up to 50% after five — and does it discount only the own-damage part?",
      "Are the add-ons the ones you actually need — zero depreciation for a car under five years, engine protection in a flood-prone city?",
      "Is the personal accident cover included — ₹750 for ₹15 lakh — unless you already hold a separate PA policy of ₹15 lakh or more?",
