        "About 58–70 g for general health (0.83–1.0 g per kg), 84–98 g with regular exercise, and 112–154 g when building muscle (1.6–2.2 g per kg). The ICMR RDA for 70 kg is 58 g — the minimum to prevent deficiency, not a training target."
