        "How many bricks do I need for a 10 × 10 ft wall?",
        "For a 9-inch wall in traditional 230 × 115 × 75 mm bricks: 833 bricks exact, 875 to buy with 5% wastage, plus 2.58 bags of cement exact (buy 3) and 19.0 cft of sand at a 1:6 mix. The same wall in modular 190 × 90 × 90 mm bricks needs 1,062 exact and 1,116 to buy — about 25% more, because each modular brick is smaller."
