    "rateNote": "Every constant on this page comes from the five fetched calculators, and each one is checkable against them. Brick sizes vary by kiln and region — the sizes below are the estimating standards, not a substitute for measuring the batch you buy. The indicative rates are NineClip's October 2026 band; enter your own local rates for a real quote.",
