    "checklist": [
      "Did you measure finished floor to finished floor — including the slab and the floor finish on both floors?",
      "Is every riser exactly the same height — or does the first or last step differ because the finish thickness was ignored?",
      "Is the actual riser 190 mm or less — and the tread 250 mm or more?",
      "Does the longest flight have 12 risers or fewer — or, if it has 13–15, is the building a high-rise?",
      "Is the stair at least 1.0 m wide — or at least 0.9 m if it is a single-family internal stair?",
      "Is 2R + T inside 600–650 mm — or, if it is outside, do you know why?",
      "Is the landing as deep as the stair is wide — and is the room long enough for the going plus the landing?",
      "Is there 2.2 m of headroom everywhere on the stair — and is the space under the mid-landing storage, not a walk-through?",
      "For concrete: is the waist 150 mm or the thickness your engineer specified — not a guess from the span rule alone?",
      "Is the rate your supplier's current ₹ per m³ — not a price from an old chart?"
    ],
