        "M10, M15, M20 and M25 need different amounts of sand per cubic metre: 0.462, 0.44, 0.42 and 0.385 m³. Mortar ratios differ more — 1:6 needs 1.14 m³ per cubic metre of wet mortar, 1:3 needs 0.998 m³. Pick the grade or ratio on the drawing, not the one you remember."
