        "Adding all the thicknesses into one lump area",
        "18 mm, 12 mm and 6 mm are different boards at different prices. A lump total of 240 sq ft says 8 sheets — but split properly it is 6 of 18 mm, 3 of 12 mm and 2 of 6 mm, and the 18 mm is the one you will run short of. Count each thickness separately."
