        <ul class="checklist">
          <li><strong>Fix the guest count first.</strong> Every quote must be for the same headcount, or the numbers cannot be compared.</li>
          <li><strong>Ask for the all-in per-head price.</strong> Service staff, crockery, delivery and cleanup included — not a food-only rate.</li>
          <li><strong>Get the 18% GST in writing.</strong> Vendor quotes usually exclude it; the number finance sees must include it.</li>
          <li><strong>Confirm what the venue hire includes.</strong> Hours, power backup, parking, cleaning and the outside-caterer fee, if any.</li>
          <li><strong>Compare at least three quotes in the same city tier.</strong> A Tier 1 quote and a Tier 3 quote are different events at different prices.</li>
        </ul>
