          <p class="calc-small" id="monthly-note">The principal and interest in each month are rounded to the nearest rupee, so they can differ from the EMI by a rupee. The final month is adjusted so the balance closes at exactly zero: its payment is ₹3,319, a few rupees under the EMI. The principal column sums to exactly ₹1,00,000 and the interest column to exactly ₹19,572.</p>
