          <p class="calc-small" id="pt-note">Maharashtra and Karnataka charge ₹200 a month and ₹300 in February — ₹2,500 a year. Tamil Nadu, Kerala, Madhya Pradesh, Jharkhand and Bihar levy the tax half-yearly or annually, so the figure shown is the annual top-slab amount (₹2,500). Odisha repealed its professional tax from 1 April 2026, so it is ₹0 in FY 2026-27. Chhattisgarh and Meghalaya are not listed: their schedules could not be verified from a citable source.</p>
