          <p class="calc-small" id="cpi-note">CPI is published by the Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI). The index is the annual average for the financial year; the inflation column is the year-on-year change in that average. Use the index the way Palz does: a value in one year is worth amount × CPI(later) ÷ CPI(earlier) in the later year.</p>
