            <p class="scope-note">
              <strong>This is an estimate for planning only, not tax advice.</strong>
              Rules are as of November 2026: the ₹25,00,000 ceiling from CBDT Notification No. 31/2023 (24 May 2023, w.e.f. 1 April 2023); the exemption in s.10(10AA) of the Income-tax Act, 1961, carried forward in s.19 of the Income-tax Act, 2025 (from 1 April 2026). The exemption is available under both the old and the new tax regime — only the tax rate on the taxable balance depends on the regime, and this calculator does not work out that tax. Confirm the final figure with your payroll team or a chartered accountant. Leave salary paid to legal heirs on the death of an employee is not taxable (CBDT Circular No. 309, 3 July 1981).
            </p>
