          <p class="calc-small" id="breakdown-note">Only 240 of the 300 days count towards the exemption — 30 days for each of 8 completed years — so limb 4 is (₹80,000.00 ÷ 30) × 240 = ₹6,40,000.00, the least of the four limbs. The total exempt is exactly Aalekh's published ₹6,40,000.</p>
