    n2 = "Breakup of the typical total: materials ₹" + interiorDesignFmtINR(materialsTyp) + " (45–60% — NoBroker), labour ₹" + interiorDesignFmtINR(labourTyp) + " (25–35%), design fees ₹" + interiorDesignFmtINR(designTyp) + " (8–15%), project management ₹" + interiorDesignFmtINR(pmTyp) + " (5–7%).";
