        <p>Crossing 50% DA lifts HRA from 27% to 30% — ${moneyText(daRows[2].r.hra - daRows[1].r.hra)} a month on this basic pay. Above 50% the HRA tier stops moving, so the gross rises only by the DA itself: from 50% to 63% the gross rises by ${moneyText(daRows[4].r.grossMonthly - daRows[2].r.grossMonthly)} a month, all of it DA.</p>
